# Every change is routed to the owner for review (ADR 0016; security reviews round 4 G1,
# round 5 H4, round 6 J7). With one maintainer, who is also the author of every pull request,
# GitHub requests no review: until a second maintainer exists, the control is the owner
# reading the diff before merging. Enforced once the main ruleset requires code-owner review
# (docs/security/risk-register.md).
*                               @HuseinHbz

